You should have magic mapped/treasure detected all levels, and found
and marked the vibrating square.  If you aren't going to use passwall,
you should also dig paths between the stairs.

There is no "mysterious force" dragging you back in slashem, so you
don't need to worry about getting pulled down into a unexplored part of
the level, but it might make sense to levitate on your way up to avoid
trapdoors.

It can be handy to collect blessed potions of monster detection, since
monks can't cast skilled "detect monster".

